      powerful radio galaxies
    journal: Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society
    year: 2017
    volume: 466
    issue: 4
    start: 4346
    notes: >-
      Source of the MiraBest morphology labels. Verified.
      The citation for the MiraBest_F dataset release itself
      is NOT yet verified - see third_party/README.md.
